From: OE-Alliance <oe-alliance@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Add legacy Enigma2 STB CEC adapters

Use the BCM and Dream driver ABIs alongside Linux CEC and USB adapters.
Retain the kernel-owned logical address, do not fake poll acknowledgements,
and keep E2 handover independent from CEC power control.

Upstream-Status: Pending

